import ../../../ui/shader_attachments.dl

set cube to a UI shader image view of "sky" at level 3 layer 5
set color to a UI shader color attachment using cube resolving into (a new JSON-RPC null) loading "clear" storing "store" cleared to [2.0,-0.5,0.25,1.0]
set view to the JSON member named "view" in color
require condition (((the JSON text named "image" in view) = "sky") and (((the JSON number named "level" in view) = 3) and ((the JSON number named "layer" in view) = 5))) reporting "An attachment lost its cube face or mip level"
set channels to the JSON member named "clear" in color
require condition (((the JSON number at index 0 in channels) = 2.0) and ((the JSON number at index 1 in channels) = -0.5)) reporting "HDR clear values were clamped to display colors"
require condition ((the kind of (the JSON member named "resolve" in color)) = the JSON null kind) reporting "An ordinary image acquired an implicit resolve target"
free color

set target to a UI shader image view of "samples" at level 0 layer 0
set resolved to a UI shader image view of "output" at level 0 layer 0
set color to a UI shader color attachment using target resolving into resolved loading "load" storing "discard" cleared to [0.0,0.0,0.0,1.0]
require condition (((the JSON text named "load" in color) = "load") and ((the JSON text named "store" in color) = "discard")) reporting "Attachment load and store operations were coupled"
require condition ((the JSON text named "image" in (the JSON member named "resolve" in color)) = "output") reporting "The resolve target was replaced by the multisample image"
free color

set depth to a UI shader depth attachment using (a UI shader image view of "shadow" at level 0 layer 0) loading "clear" storing "store" cleared to 0.75
require condition ((the JSON number named "clear" in depth) = 0.75) reporting "The shadow depth clear value changed"
free depth

set state to a UI shader raster state culling "back" facing "ccw" writing depth true comparing "less-equal" blending "alpha"
require condition (((the JSON text named "cullMode" in state) = "back") and ((the JSON text named "frontFace" in state) = "ccw")) reporting "Raster orientation was lost"
require condition (((the JSON boolean named "depthWrite" in state) = true) and ((the JSON text named "depthCompare" in state) = "less-equal")) reporting "Depth testing was coupled to blending"
set blend to the JSON member named "blend" in state
require condition (((the JSON text named "srcFactor" in (the JSON member named "color" in blend)) = "src-alpha") and ((the JSON text named "dstFactor" in (the JSON member named "alpha" in blend)) = "one-minus-src-alpha")) reporting "Alpha blending was replaced by additive blending"
free state

set image to a UI shader frame image named "samples" storing "rgba16float" with 4 samples
require condition (((the JSON number named "samples" in image) = 4) and ((the JSON text named "kind" in (the JSON member named "size" in image)) = "frame")) reporting "A multisample frame target lost its resize policy"
free image
print line "Shader attachments preserve subresources, resolves, HDR clears, load/store operations and independent raster state."
